ation related to the resident's needs, appeal rights, or bed-hold policies.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0689":{"code":"F-0689","title":"Ensure that a nursing home area is free from accident hazards and provides adequate supervision to prevent accidents.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0686":{"code":"F-0686","title":"Provide appropriate pressure ulcer care and prevent new ulcers from developing.","category":"Quality of Life and Care Deficiencies","concept":"clinical_care","concept_label":"Clinical care"},"cms-f0607":{"code":"F-0607","title":"Develop and implement policies and procedures to prevent abuse, neglect, and theft.","category":"Freedom from Abuse, Neglect, and Exploitation Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-k0712":{"code":"K-0712","title":"Have simulated fire drills held at unexpected times.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0211":{"code":"K-0211","title":"Keep aisles, corridors, and exits free of obstruction in case of emergency.","category":"Egress Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0321":{"code":"K-0321","title":"Ensure that special areas are constructed so that walls can resist fire for one hour or have an approved fire extinguishing system.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0353":{"code":"K-0353","title":"Inspect, test, and maintain automatic sprinkler systems.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0801":{"code":"F-0801","title":"Employ sufficient staff with the appropriate competencies a